        "original_id": "2281792f-3dd4-5b36-ad4b-5117ad07f931",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Entrepreneur magazine, Optimize magazine, Further\n- Companies: Lifted Research Group, Asylum Records\n- Topics: entrepreneurship, small business management, business\n\nFacts:\n- Entrepreneur is an American magazine and website that carries news stories about entrepreneurship, small business management, and business.\n- Entrepreneur was first published in 1977.\n- Optimize was an American monthly business magazine published from November 2001 to June 2007.\n- In 2007, Entrepreneur ranked Lifted Research Group at number 5 on its Hot 500 list of fastest-growing companies.\n- Entrepreneur publishes 12 issues annually and makes them available by subscription and on newsstands.\n- Further was first released by Lifted Research Group in autumn 2009.\n- Further was re-released by Asylum Records on March 19, 2010.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
